  "releaseNotes": "V 1.5.2\n\t\t  - SourceCurrency, ExchangeRate and TransactionAmount set to required for banking.account.transaction.received event.\n\t\t  V 1.5.1\n\t\t  - Added Charge, CurrencyExchange and AmountDetails to banking.account.transaction.received event\n\t\t  V 1.5.0\n\t\t  - Added links to payment events\n\t\t  V 1.4.1\n\t\t  - New references, debtor and creditor fields added for banking.account.transaction.received event\n\t\t  V 1.4.0\n\t\t  - New remittance fields and payment references, old remittances deprecated\n\t\t  V 1.3.1\n\t\t  - BalanceAmount and TransactionAmount value property renamed from Value to Amount\n\t\t  V 1.2.1\n\t\t  - Added InstructionId to banking.account.transaction.received event\n\t\t  V 1.2.0\n\t\t  - Added banking.account.balance.updated event\n\t\t  - Added banking.account.transaction.received event\n\t\t  V 1.1.0\n\t\t  - Added EndToEndIdentification to PaymentStatusUpdated event\n\t\t  - Added xml docs\n\t\t  V 1.0.0\n\t\t  - Added banking.account.created Event\n\t\t  - Added banking.payment.status.updated Event",
